From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: swarm-inference-lab <experiment-010@localhost>
Date: Mon, 3 Aug 2026 17:48:06 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] Add OLMoE memory residency telemetry and data planes

Downstream Experiment 010 integration under Apache-2.0. Add physical memory
residency accounting, bounded native expert caching, capacity-isolated startup,
real shared-memory and relayed data planes, native CUDA expert execution,
deterministic failure and corruption handling, and observation-only numerical
tracing without changing routing, model weights, tokenization, or sampling.

